rest of Asia, and Europe. It provides customizable process technologies, including SiGe, SiPho, mixed signal CMOS, RF CMOS, CMOS image sensors, non-imaging sensors, wafers, and integrated power management. The company also offers a design enablement platform for a design cycle, as well as transfer optimization and development process services to integrated device manufacturers and fabless companies. It serves consumer applications, personal computers, communications, handsets and smartphones, automotive, industrial, aerospace, and medical device markets. The company was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Migdal Haemek, Israel.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Russell C.  Ellwanger | CEO & Director | Age 70","financial_summary":["Tower Semiconductor Ltd. is a large-cap technology business with a $15.6B market cap on $1.6B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -2% over the past three years and +5% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 13% against a 10% cost of capital, a 3-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it, and 22% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The company is burning through $49M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 53\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 379% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":3.7944226610448277},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $60.0M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Technology peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Antitrust and platform-regulation risk \u2014 the larger the network effect, the larger the regulatory target on its back, and a single consent decree can reset the moat.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 8% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Comparing DAQO New Energy (NYSE:DQ) & Tower Semiconductor (NASDAQ:TSEM)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/comparing-daqo-new-energy-nysedq-tower-semiconductor-nasdaqtsem.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793988928.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.952,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{